body:
Previously, writing `jamf.createClient({` and hitting ctrl+space would suggest that you implement `API` yourself in an object literal. That's not... great.

```typescript
const api = jamf.createAPI({ /* ... */ });
// before:
const client = jamf.createClient(api);
// after:
const client = jamf.createClient({ api });
```

